              },
              {
                "name": "stream_ids",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "A list of stream IDs to report on, one value per line (e.g. no delimiter), defaulting to all streams. Use the [streams](ref:care-analytics-api#list-all-available-streams-for-a-company) endpoint to get the appropriate stream IDs."
